@startuml
title Design Patterns — integração e atualização de cliente
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor "Cliente HTTP" as User
component "ClienteRestController" as Controller
component "ClienteService <<interface>>" as Interface
component "ClienteServiceImpl" as Facade
database "ClienteRepository / H2" as Clientes
database "EnderecoRepository / H2" as Enderecos
cloud "ViaCepService (OpenFeign)" as ViaCep
User --> Controller : POST /clientes, PUT /clientes/{id}, GET, DELETE
Controller --> Interface
Interface <|.. Facade
Facade --> Clientes : findById, save, deleteById
Facade --> Enderecos : findById(CEP normalizado)
Facade --> ViaCep : consultarCep(CEP), só cache miss
note bottom of Facade
  POST descarta ID de entrada.
  PUT preserva ID da URL e responde
  entidade persistida com CEP normalizado.
  400 invalid input; 404 sem cliente;
  422 CEP inválido da API; 502 falha de rede.
end note
@enduml
